  "description": "1-12. **Yasi** (야시; The Night Market)\n*Do you dare enter the night market?*\nOne day Mia finds Yuji, an old friend from high school, waiting for her outside her house. She reluctantly agrees to go with him to a night market which turns out to be run by demons. To make matters worse, they can't seem to escape. Does Yuji know more about this strange place than he lets on?\n\n13-24. **Baramui Dosi** (바람의 도시; The City of Wind)\n*Care for a stroll on a mysterious path?*\nLost in a park, Jun finds his way home thanks to a mysterious woman he meets on an even more mysterious path. Years later, he revisits this bizarre road with his friend, Haru. They soon discover that not only is this place filled with monsters, but they can't return home! Will they find a way out? \n\n(Source: Manta, edited)\n\n*Note: Contains a prologue chapter*",
